  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 5857 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E5"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 683318 of Baxter Healthcare Corporation (FEI 2650090) ended on 2010-09-30 and was classified OAI with a known date of 2010-12-29.",
      "cites": ["E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That OAI classification occurred 5857 days before the posting date of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Baxter plant was later inspected and classified VAI on 2015-02-06, 2018-10-24, and most recently on 2025-03-26.",
      "cites": ["E6", "E7", "E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A second registered plant for sevoflurane, Bryant Ranch Prepack (FEI 1000519407), received an OAI classification on 2009-06-11 and a Warning Letter on 2010-04-08.",
      "cites": ["E13", "E22"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bryant Ranch Prepack has since received VAI classifications through the most recent inspection ending 2026-07-16.",
      "cites": ["E21"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 386 units at 16.6 per day (23 days on hand) and can spare 92 units while retaining two weeks of supply.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 130 units at 15.8 per day (8 days on hand) and would reach 14 days on hand after receiving the transfer.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    }
  ]
}
